unmask-release
==============

This package configures your system to use the unmask package repository
hosted at https://unmask.sh/dl/.

Files installed:

  RHEL / Rocky / AlmaLinux:
    /etc/pki/rpm-gpg/RPM-GPG-KEY-unmask          GPG public signing key
    /etc/yum.repos.d/unmask.repo                  yum/dnf repository definition

  Debian / Ubuntu:
    /etc/apt/keyrings/unmask.gpg                  GPG public signing key
    /etc/apt/sources.list.d/unmask.sources        apt repository (deb-822)

  Alpine:
    /etc/apk/keys/unmask-release@unmask.sh.rsa.pub  RSA public signing key
    /etc/apk/repositories                           apk repository (one line appended)

After installing this package you can install unmask with:

    dnf install unmask                            # RHEL/Rocky/AlmaLinux
    apt update && apt install unmask              # Debian/Ubuntu
    apk update && apk add unmask                  # Alpine

To verify the key fingerprint outside of this package, see:
    https://unmask.sh/keys/

Project: https://unmask.sh/
